      'NEW — **Purchase Orders** module (sidebar → OPERATIONS → Purchase Orders, shortcut **9**). Each PO carries: supplier, PO number, currency + exchange rate to USD (locked at PO creation, so historical reports do not drift when the FX rate moves), Incoterm (EXW / FOB / CFR aka CNF / CIF), container type (20\' / 40\' / 40HQ / LCL), ordered date, ETA, status (Draft → Ordered → In transit → Received → Closed), notes. Header fields auto-save on blur. The status pill flips colour by state (slate / sky / amber / emerald) so the list scans fast.',
