      'NEW — **Cost Calculator** module (sidebar → OPERATIONS → Cost Calculator). Pick a product to load its latest landed cost, type a target margin %, see the suggested retail. Or type a retail and see the realized margin. Quick-chips for 20%/25%/30%/35%/40%/45%/50%/55%/60% margin targets show the retail at each tier — useful for sanity-checking wholesale vs retail splits. **Margin is of-retail** (profit ÷ retail), not markup-over-cost — the formula matches how catalog retailers price.',
