      'Build fix: Intel DMG (v0.26.45) crashed at launch with `Could not load the "sharp" module using the darwin-x64 runtime`. Root cause was sharp 0.33+ using platform-specific binaries via `optionalDependencies` — when you `npm install` on an arm64 host, npm fetches `@img/sharp-darwin-arm64` but skips `@img/sharp-darwin-x64`. So the x64 DMG packaged a sharp module with no matching native binary.',
