      'Phase 3 of 3 of the post-audit cleanup: file splits. Three of the four largest files in the codebase have been broken into focused sibling modules. Pure refactor — zero behaviour changes, every public export preserved, tests + vite build still green.',
      'Settings: `renderer/modules/Settings/index.jsx` went from 1871 → 849 lines (~55% shrinkage). Extracted into 3 sibling files: `BgModelCachePanel.jsx` (176 lines — the cache-visibility panel that was added in v0.26.39), `MultiMacPanel.jsx` (806 lines — ModeSegment + ServerModePanel + ClientModePanel + RestartBanner + MigrationPanel; all the multi-Mac UI), and `AboutPanel.jsx` (111 lines — AboutCard + AboutItem + CrashLogPanel). The Settings tab dispatcher + inline general/library/AI tab content stays in index.jsx.',
      'ProductLibrary: `renderer/modules/ProductLibrary/index.jsx` went from 1452 → 857 lines. Extracted into 4 sibling files: `LibraryTable.jsx` (173 lines — table view + sort headers + row renderer), `LibraryGrid.jsx` (279 lines — grid cards + hover-cycle + size control + persistence), `LibraryColumns.jsx` (150 lines — column picker + defs + visibility persistence), and `libraryConstants.js` (20 lines — shared status option lists used by 3+ files). `loadHoverPreview`/`saveHoverPreview` remain exported from index.jsx so Settings continues to import them unchanged.',
