      'Polish: the Export Center category filter now persists across navigation — same pattern the Library Table/Grid view toggle uses (v0.26.23). Pick "Bathtub" once, work through them, navigate to Settings, come back → still "Bathtub". Cleared by switching to "All categories" or unticking the filter manually.',
      'Per-company scoping: the saved filter is keyed by the active company id (`ExportCenter.categoryFilter.<companyId>`). Category IDs are scoped per-company, so persisting globally would mean switching company resurrected gibberish ids from another company. Each company remembers its own last-used filter independently.',
