      'New: category filter in Export Center. Dropdown sits next to the search box; pick a category to narrow the queue list. Combines with search — "search SKU + filter category" both apply at once. "All categories" (the default) means no category filter.',
      'Updated: "Select all" now reflects the active filter. When you have a category or search filter set, the button label changes to "Select all in filter (N)" — picks just the products matching what you can see, not all 1700+. Used to be implicit (the original button already operated on the filtered list); now the label spells it out so you can tell at a glance what clicking it will do. With no filter active, the label stays "Select all" and selects the full catalog like before.',
