      'Note for context: kie.ai and fal.ai are the upstream API providers; the model names in the dropdown describe which Google / OpenAI / Black Forest Labs / ByteDance model runs through that provider. The provider prefix is what tells the runner whether to use the kie.ai client or the fal.ai client — without it the runner has no idea where to send the request.',
