      'If you saw this raw error in the past few weeks and wondered whether your edits had saved: they had not — the server rejected the write because of a timestamp mismatch. Now the dialog gives you a real choice. Picking Refresh pulls the current row; Overwrite re-saves your version (other person\'s changes get clobbered); Cancel leaves the form as-is so you can copy text out.',
