      'Update events store ONLY the keys that changed — a 30-field product edit where you renamed it stores one key on each side. Keeps log rows small (~150 bytes typical) and the diff display obvious. Unchanged values, computed fields (updatedAt, updatedByUserId), and the conflict-detection token never appear in the log.',
